<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-03T23:33:07.573Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 23:33:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue abducting civilians and attacking security forces across northern Nigeria, including the kidnapping of a university student in Plateau, the abduction of two visually impaired persons in Plateau, and the seizure of 14 schoolchildren from a farm. Security operatives have rescued multiple victims, such as eight abducted residents in Kaduna, a pregnant woman and seven others in Kaduna, and a group of 37 worshippers held for 212 days in Kaduna. Bandits have killed vigilantes and police officers, including a vigilante member in Plateau and five police officers in a Sokoto-Zamfara highway ambush. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOZG85U0dfcnMxMTFuUFF1czZwb1Nta1Z2R0lyWWFJX0s1clltTGpsSmh0SW1JTXV1Uzl3SHYxbGotRVVTZHdXSUlBLVk5RTZZZElpbTBGNjFWcVFpTC1lVEZkTVpPRTc4cXFiNXRrSFNfSnhyV3lBSVNzUmp0RmNKUGF4NDdVanJqaXg4cVdsZGNNMDZHZHZ6V3dfanZ6ZEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQWC1TVFpvcnN3NGpieUlwSXJYUF9Zd1ZVczRaOENtd1VrREY4SVVOOVhZU1g3RDA0N0R1Z3JGRk9ncEtzc0NJeUROWS1SZ0p5eUtGRFdnRmhuQUZYMzNhOENCS3BiUnpNXzE5Wk9zNG5yTlVYZ21kOHcwa29Sc1RPOFR4eE9WbThMemtZWDJIaENsamJhNXgtLUVOZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPTmRvLUgwdW5xbDl5cTAxWW9wak5xdXpWb3ROTTFReGxXUzYyQjlVOUJ2X2ROZjIxR3Rna2ZWeDNPcW54eGF6d2Y4QVladmZuaG9FeE9xeVU4NG1GWWdLUWhEc29acF9KVkRGVHVGUk5ZQi1CQnFNX0JMYVFPZlZGLThJR2pzUkIta1RhejlNMDRVNUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheCable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNY1Z5cGQ3UzJqYVJhRFZFOW5nTlNYNzVwd2ZSTnE3cTMwQmo3aDNKNFFNUm1RUkYycVlReXF2UGlCNnpjcHpLYWVfUF8yRkZ0dVRnSTE3bkNjRXp1RE5XMm1zUEtMWjJPUUJaNmk3M2FLWEFkX25oX2NQV